# Standards & Clarity Review Checklist

Full scored report: `evals/STANDARDS_CLARITY_EVALUATION.md`. Apply **only** the section matching touched paths.

## Path triage

| Path pattern | Layer |
|--------------|-------|
| `src/cc/**` except `**/gen-*/**` | A |
| `src/thrift/swcdb/*.{thrift,CMakeLists.txt}` | A |
| `src/cc/include/swcdb/thrift/{broker,client,utils}/**` | A |
| `**/thriftgen-*/**`, `**/gen-cpp/**`, `**/gen-c_glib/**`, `**/thrift/**/gen/**`, py/java/rb gen variants | B |

## Layer A — Hand-written

- [ ] Copyright header on **new** source
- [ ] `.h`/`.cc`; PascalCase type files; guard `#ifndef swcdb_..._h` (no `#pragma once`)
- [ ] `"swcdb/..."` project includes; `<...>` third-party
- [ ] Namespace/directory matches module map (`.cursor/rules/architecture-overview.mdc`)
- [ ] `Ptr` typedef / shared ownership patterns; match neighbor style
- [ ] `SWC_THROW` / `SWC_LOG*`; no new silent `catch(...)`
- [ ] Wire command: `Commands.h` → handler → params/req → AppContext → clients
- [ ] No upward/`core`→`db` or daemon cross-includes
- [ ] No new unconditional `#include "*.cc"` in daemon headers without note
- [ ] Prefer new files under 1000 LOC; justify exceptions
- [ ] Thrift behavior: edit IDL and/or wrappers — not `gen-*`

## Layer B — Thrift-generated

- [ ] Do **not** edit for style/naming/clarity
- [ ] Shape changes in IDL → regenerate (`thriftgen-${VER}` / CMake)
- [ ] Logic stays in wrappers (`AppHandler`, `Client`, `Converter`, binding clients)
- [ ] Do not apply Layer A formatting or copyright/guard renames to generated trees
- [ ] Do not build on `*_server.skeleton.cpp`
